<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 219-1 AT TEA V NEW ZEALAND (249).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 219-1 AT TEA V NEW ZEALAND (249).</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 219-1 in reply to New Zealand's first innings of 249 at tea on the second day of the second test on Friday.</p>
</text>
